    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.11_base_commutative_diagram.chapters.27_governance_shacl_deep_dive.sections.01_governance_as_commutative_constraint.concrete_anchor_2#governancegate_g" .
silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_27_governance_shacl_deep_dive_sections_01_governance_as_commutative_constraint_concrete_anchor_2#governancegate_g silm:hasLongDescription "The GovernanceGate_G is the governance gate G: checks whether the new vet-record leg commutes with the existing classification, refinement, and prior evidence legs. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'GovernanceGate_G', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
